      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-desc">De-escalation path:</strong> F13 at 45% × P(F9=NO) ≈ 38% — conditional on Omani mediation and Qatar/Pakistan framework converting the current bilateral pause to an MFA/State-level named ceasefire before EOD August 15.</p>
